{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":33692942,"ns":0,"title":"Appropriation of knowledge","extract":"Appropriation of knowledge is the process of constructing knowledge from social and cultural sources, and integrating it into pre-existing schemas. It is a developmental process that comes about through socially formulated, goal-directed, and tool-mediated actions.","description":"Educational psychology concept","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}